RemCTL — Reminders command-line tool by Federico Viticci
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Reminders SQLite enrichment in `src/eventkit-cli/RemindersDB.swift` (and, in a
later change, the private-ReminderKit write path in `src/eventkit-cli/RemindersPrivate.m`)
is a Swift/Objective-C re-implementation that PORTS the proven primitives from RemCTL:
the store-location heuristic, the Core Data schema and SQL queries, and the ReminderKit
selector sequence. Orchestration was rewritten; the queries and selectors are RemCTL's.

What was ported into RemindersDB.swift (read path, Phase 1):
  - Store location: largest `Data-*.sqlite` under
    `~/Library/Group Containers/group.com.apple.reminders/Container_v1/Stores/`
    (RemCTL `remctl:194`, `remctl_runtime.py:13`).
  - Tags: `SELECT o.ZREMINDER3, h.ZNAME FROM ZREMCDOBJECT o
    JOIN ZREMCDHASHTAGLABEL h ON o.ZHASHTAGLABEL = h.Z_PK`
    (RemCTL `remctl_serialization.py:155-159`).
  - flagged / subtask: `ZREMCDREMINDER.ZFLAGGED`, `ZREMCDREMINDER.ZPARENTREMINDER`.
  - Sections: `ZREMCDBASESECTION` + per-reminder membership
    (RemCTL `remctl:1481-1526`, `q_section_memberships` at `remctl:1493-1526`).
  - Full Disk Access is a manual grant with no Info.plist usage key
    (RemCTL `remctl-permissions.swift:124,193`).

What was ported into RemindersPrivate.m + .h (write path, Phase 2):
  - The private ReminderKit @interface declarations and the fetch→change→save flow
    from RemCTL `remctl-private.m`: REMStore / REMSaveRequest / REMReminderChangeItem /
    REMObjectID / REMMembership / REMMemberships, the `x-apple-reminderkit://` URL
    shapes (`:344-358`), and the per-feature selectors —
      * flagged: `[[change flaggedContext] setFlagged:]` (`:1375`)
      * tags:    `[hashtagContext addHashtagWithType:1 name:]` (`:1450`)
      * subtask: `addReminderWithTitle:toReminderSubtaskContextChangeItem:` (`:1283`)
      * section: REMMembership + `setUnsavedMembershipsOfRemindersInSections:`,
                 `addListSectionWithDisplayName:` (`:1298-1323`)
      * save:    `saveSynchronouslyWithError:` (`:1455`)
  - Existing-section resolution by name: `resolveSectionCkid` in RemindersDB.swift,
    from RemCTL `resolve_section_ckid` (`remctl:3073`).

